Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.43,0:00:07.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:18.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:23.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:27.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:34.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:41.16,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:49.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.24,0:00:55.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:59.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:03.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:10.29,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.43,0:01:21.40,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.77,0:01:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城主大人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:43.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.21,0:01:47.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专门接受咒术工作的邪恶巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:50.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想得到永远青春的椿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:54.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接受了奈落以四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:56.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交换黑巫女诅咒之力的请求
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.46,0:02:00.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由于黑巫女的使魔 式神
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:04.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我下咒 并操纵我的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:12.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片…进入了我的身体？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:14.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.91,0:02:22.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快…逃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.78,0:02:23.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:28.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管痛苦吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.09,0:02:32.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点逃…犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:42.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第61话 突然出现的桔梗与式神巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.36,0:03:07.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:10.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再一次被心爱的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:13.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以箭矢相向的感觉如何
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:38.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…你居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.39,0:03:45.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像当年被桔梗杀害时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:47.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次透过戈薇的手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:50.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走向与五十年前相同的命运吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.53,0:03:52.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就好好品尝痛苦的滋味吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:54.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里布下了很强的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.05,0:04:08.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女在这里面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.65,0:04:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都已经来到这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师 没办法打破结界吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.86,0:04:19.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:28.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:30.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我而言太勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:33.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.69,0:04:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:46.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:48.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满污秽的邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:51.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:57.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…犬夜叉的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.60,0:05:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这结界里面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:04.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:11.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:37.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选个你喜欢的吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:39.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被戈薇杀害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:42.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是逃走以保住性命呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你逃走的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.02,0:05:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇就会死
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:50.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死在黑巫女的诅咒之下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:54.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你…快点逃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:56.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:58.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.53,0:06:01.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎能丢下你逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.27,0:06:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子那个叫犬夜叉的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.18,0:06:15.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望被那女人杀害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:21.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你也是个狠毒的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让桔梗的转世
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:27.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再次杀害心爱的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:37.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:40.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗竟然出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:52.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:55.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她身为巫女的力量可不容小觑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:59.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠椿那家伙没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:02.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就随她去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:05.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄清楚她到底想做什么也好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:29.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:31.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:33.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:35.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脑袋里的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:37.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:39.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:44.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我去…我感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.40,0:07:48.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:52.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.74,0:07:53.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:56.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别逞强 你怎么能起来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:07:59.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个声音停止了…趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去找她吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:03.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万不能小看黑巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.99,0:08:06.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了咒术还没解开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:09.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会保护戈薇的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:10.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇不会有事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.63,0:08:18.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么痛苦的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:19.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:22.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇是很坚强的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:23.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉也跟在她身边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:27.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就等戈薇她们平安回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:30.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇要加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:34.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇现在正拼命忍耐着痛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:37.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你绝对不能让戈薇死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:39.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何都要切断咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.99,0:08:43.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要坚守着戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:52.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.37,0:08:57.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那支箭又不是你射的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.24,0:08:59.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别再放在心上了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:04.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明找到敌人的所在位置了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:07.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这段时间黑巫女的咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:08.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定也还持续着
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.02,0:09:11.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再拖下去戈薇的身体会撑不住
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难打破这个结界也说不定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:19.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总比什么都不做光看来得好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:21.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上吧 法师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:22.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.42,0:09:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.55,0:09:45.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫戈薇的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:50.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…不是你的转世吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:52.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.93,0:09:57.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你诅咒了戈薇吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:09:58.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:01.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭你这点力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:04.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别瞧不起人 桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:08.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不再是被你打败时的我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:10.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用你说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.35,0:10:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到外表就一目了然了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:16.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿…你为了青春
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.95,0:10:19.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将魂魄卖给妖怪了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:23.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了青春…还有美貌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:31.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此青春与美貌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:35.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有失去的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.87,0:10:38.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是非神之人的宿命吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.61,0:10:40.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:43.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要得到桔梗保护的四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.61,0:10:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这份美貌就能永远维持着
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我变成人类？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,办得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:53.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你本来就是半个人类
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.73,0:10:57.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉如果交给邪恶的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:11:00.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖力会更加强大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你使用它变成人类的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能让玉净化 甚至可能会消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:12.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候桔梗…你要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:15.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是守护玉的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.38,0:11:18.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有了玉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:20.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就只是普通的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:46.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被半妖夺走了心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.44,0:11:48.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能打倒现在的桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:56.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧 我的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:11:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,务必要夺取四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十年前的那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.48,0:12:21.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 由于你弹回了我的咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:27.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脸…我的脸…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:49.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然没有夺得 你拥有的四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:50.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我与妖怪结合
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而得到如此永恒的青春美丽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.01,0:12:57.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也自然的得到了妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:12:59.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:02.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有资格说别人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:04.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你能保持
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.39,0:13:06.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候的模样站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:12.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.03,0:13:15.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是已死之人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.27,0:13:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那身体既非人类也非妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:22.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是伪造物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:28.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 你这已死之人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.91,0:13:31.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢对我说教
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:35.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来确认邪气的源头
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:39.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的身体变得怎样我不管
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:43.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:49.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 为什么不逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.07,0:13:59.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才说过了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:01.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能丢下你逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.81,0:14:03.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个不小心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:05.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会变的与桔梗那时候一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算真是那样我也不会逃的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:09.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到此为止 我不想再听了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.59,0:14:19.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:23.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那结界里面…就是敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:30.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢被净化了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:34.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.34,0:14:35.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇搞的鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:37.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就说过了 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:39.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭你这点程度的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:41.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是无法诅咒戈薇的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.85,0:14:42.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.12,0:14:45.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你在这节骨眼突然出现
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:50.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种结界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种结界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:20.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界被打破了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:31.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的结界被…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:35.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇…箭没有射中吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:51.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 你做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:54.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想让犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.88,0:16:01.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被戈薇的箭射杀吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:03.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:06.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回想起不愉快的往事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:09.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 是我让戈薇射的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:11.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.29,0:16:15.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你当年射杀犬夜叉一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.87,0:16:33.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿…你想对戈薇怎样我不管
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.55,0:16:36.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果你对犬夜叉动手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:40.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候我就会杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:44.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你吓得了我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:48.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:53.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才所说的不只是威胁而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.41,0:17:04.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.91,0:17:06.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也都来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:08.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里面…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:11.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有四魂之玉…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:16.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诅咒我…操纵我的家伙也在这
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.81,0:17:34.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是黑巫女吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.81,0:17:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是椿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:40.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗的心上人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.71,0:17:41.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:44.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿 桔梗姑娘怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:46.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她应该在里面的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.65,0:17:47.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.95,0:17:50.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也亲眼看见的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗向祠堂走去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.53,0:17:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:56.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.86,0:17:59.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人似乎是来乞求饶你一命的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.40,0:18:04.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗现在还是对犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:06.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使身为已死之人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对思念的男人依然恋恋不舍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.31,0:18:10.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不肯死的彻底一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:11.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.75,0:18:12.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.18,0:18:14.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.91,0:18:15.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:18.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 从刚才听起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:21.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我们了解的满多的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.89,0:18:23.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏要大费周章的用操纵戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:26.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来射杀我的手段才甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:28.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背地里穿针引线的是奈落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:31.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.20,0:18:33.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就更不能饶你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.17,0:18:35.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你死！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.34,0:18:36.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.94,0:18:39.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你敢拔刀的话 戈薇就死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:45.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:48.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诅咒依然在持续着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要四魂之玉在我的身上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.58,0:18:54.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇的性命就任我摆布了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:56.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.30,0:19:08.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:16.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又再度污秽了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.81,0:19:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.81,0:19:23.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经无法再净化玉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:25.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是容易
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:28.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管玉的净化还是结界被打破
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:29.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是在桔梗的妨碍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:33.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我的诅咒中断的期间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.49,0:19:35.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭你这点程度的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.33,0:19:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是无法诅咒戈薇的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:42.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗那家伙似乎太高估戈薇了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:45.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 手段真卑劣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:49.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到完整的四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:51.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我做什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.01,0:19:55.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 就从你开始
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:10.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.47,0:20:19.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人将妖怪饲养在体内
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:40.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好不要拔刀 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.32,0:20:43.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你敢拔刀戈薇就会被咒杀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.93,0:20:46.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就凄惨的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:49.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后被我的妖怪所杀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:56.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不甘心…这个诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:58.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何要解除它
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:02.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此犬夜叉根本就束手无策
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.41,0:21:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.01,0:21:06.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧 别顾忌快打倒她
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.85,0:21:07.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.55,0:21:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动手 我体内的妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.10,0:21:29.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.15,0:21:43.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:49.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要封住刀 你就束手无策了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.99,0:21:52.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖的成为妖怪的饵食吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.46,0:21:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.70,0:22:02.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:21.15,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.89,0:22:27.89,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.77,0:22:34.83,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.54,0:22:41.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.95,0:22:48.15,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:54.96,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.76,0:23:01.49,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.73,0:23:08.50,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.24,0:23:15.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.01,0:23:22.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.82,0:23:28.99,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.39,0:23:35.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.19,0:23:48.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.53,0:23:50.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要想办法解除这咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.36,0:23:52.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.67,0:23:54.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.83,0:23:56.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么回到了现代
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.27,0:23:58.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚呢 弥勒法师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.84,0:24:01.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是…我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.21,0:24:03.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.78,0:24:05.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.48,0:24:08.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又会丧命的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.78,0:24:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.12,0:24:12.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高深莫测的阿椿咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.62,0:24:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是…戈薇啊！
